SUMMARY:Moonlight Hike - Ajax Waterfront
DESCRIPTION:GTA Hiking & Stuff\nJoin us for our second moonlight hike of t
 he season. We plan to post hikes throughout the year during the nights aro
 und the full moon. These hikes are all about the energy of the moon. We ca
 n share interesting facts about that months full moon.\n\nWe will hike at 
 a easy pace doing 5 - 6 km in 2 hrs or less. Please bring a headlamp or a 
 flashlight.\n\nThis month we will walk the path along the Ajax waterfront.
  Watching the moon rise over **Lake Ontario** is quite the experience. The
  moon looks bigger when it rises because of a trick of perception known as
  the Moon illusion. Since there will be no obstructions at the waterfront 
 we can put this illusion to the test.\n\nLet's hope it will be clear so we
  can see the sun at night. The moon can get bright enough to turn off our 
 headlamps while we hike so\, if you haven't experienced a night hike\, com
 e out and enjoy the adventure. Just don't be the last in line.😬\n\n**No
 te**\n\n- Arrive on time! Please cancel if you can't make it.\n- Know your
  limits! Hike within it.\n- Dress for the conditions.\n- Be aware and prep
 ared for ticks.\n- Free Parking.\n- No Dogs.\n- The hike will be canceled 
 if the weather doesn't cooperate.\n\n***Hike leaves promptly at 7:00 PM***
 \n\n**LEGAL DISCLAIMER AND LIABILITY INFORMATION:**\n\nBy RSVP'ing and pay
